[00:00.00] 作词 : Syd Barrett
[00:00.00][by:无为世界]
[00:00.39] 作曲 : Syd Barrett
[00:00.79]It's awfully considerate of you to think of me here
[00:00.79]你能想到我在此处 已经非常体贴了
[00:05.49]And I'm much obliged to you for making it clear
[00:05.49]我万分感激你已经弄清真相
[00:10.57]That I'm not here
[00:10.57]我并不在此处
[00:13.27]And I never knew the moon could be so big
[00:13.27]我从未见过如此大的月亮
[00:17.61]And I never knew the moon could be so blue
[00:17.61]我从未见过如此蓝的月亮
[00:21.33]And I'm grateful that you threw away my old shoes
[00:21.33]我很感激你替我扔掉了我的旧鞋
[00:25.04]And brought me here instead dressed in red
[00:25.04]把我带到此处 而不用给我套上红衣
[00:31.09]And I'm wondering who could be writing this song
[00:31.09]我想知道是谁在写这首歌
[00:38.94]I don't care if the sun don't shine
[00:38.94]我不在乎太阳不再照耀
[00:43.15]And I don't care if nothing is mine
[00:43.15]我不在乎一无所有
[00:47.44]And I don't care if I'm nervous with you
[00:47.44]我不在乎和你在一起令我紧张兮兮
[00:51.92]I'll do my loving in the winter
[00:51.92]我会在冬天收获我的爱情
[01:00.79]
[02:30.74]And the sea isn't green
[02:30.74]海水并不绿
[02:36.55]And I love the queen
[02:36.55]我爱女王陛下
[02:42.82]And what exactly is a dream
[02:42.82]究竟哪部分是梦
[02:49.87]And what exactly is a joke
[02:49.87]哪部分是玩笑呢
